    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126bc5d20b312fda09a5c64d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级后冠赛马娘的胜利，\n是继贵妇人之后的又一伟业！！\n这位赛马娘究竟能有多强啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8201071f10d82885a0fbe8e10bba9e7bb420c4e2d066b1e57a8940ee8ff492c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
