    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8cb1da32e0de0d907711f59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的奔跑从我们邂逅时起就一直……\n不曾停歇，不断进步着。\n她一定――能永无止境地变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188d3880317d14364e54c1b61685506b1022fb60a5ee1fa12a2d2b7bb02125b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
