    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7aa387dd9e851eb4f6dfb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "脑海的一角，一直怀抱着期待。\n但若非“杏目”的风格，\n就无法成为人们心中铭记的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19d8fed31f5e95dfbdc1db7e1d51d0a2599c39bf353b9d2edb0af69b65e4ff5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
