    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2518a60e83f9f75405d291d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看了今天的比赛，都会认为她的可能性是无限的！\n去往无人踏足的道路――即便是走向世界，\n她也完全可行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "630331ec1a96b70db0bf6d0942c8af8d22614bb73e96b9f9184f1beb74274870",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
