      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "古马级果然还是要走王道吗！\n为了君临这个时代，成为比赛界的新的顶点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b4418c7e2cbc9570e277e01e25d3fb895ae00ee2810769385406e134699aa5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
