    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c29ae80443df5aff67794e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蜂拥而至的记者们兴奋地说着，\n杏目的下一个伟业的形态――\n但是每一个我都感觉不太对劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e9e8f41b31a599987a5ca7d0b47ebdf006ff8f9cdec25911d04a32565ff194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
