    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6b8b8c0b594c923a4eb3c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今为止的“最强”赛马娘们。\n她们凭借各自不同的强大，\n成就了只属于自己的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ed66965d874abfbdb97677c62dd81df3cc8a3835a0b5bb94af49f181608ab6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
